# CatDex — AI Generation

## What AI may generate

- Physical attributes (breed/coat/color estimates)
- Short description
- Suggested poetic name
- Small tag set / personality (keep ≤ policy max, historically ~3 tags)
- Optional rarity hint strings

## What AI must not dictate alone

- Final name/fields — user can adjust after wow (`CaptureReveal` / adjust phase)
- Safety: `notACat` and photo problem codes must short-circuit collection add

## Product tone for generated FR copy

- Charming, local, specific — avoid generic encyclopedia dumps
- No offensive content; server prompt policies apply

## Engineering

- Prompt + schema owned by server modules
- Client displays + allows correction; corrections can flow to `analysis_feedback`
- Confidence and warnings should be visible when relevant, not hidden
